<main class="content">
<section id="discover" class="view active">
<div class="welcome"><div><h2>Discover your crew</h2><p>Verified aviation professionals matching your lifestyle preferences.</p></div></div>
<div class="filters"><button class="filter">♡ Dating</button><button class="filter">♧ Friendship</button><button class="filter">✈ Nearby Bases</button><button class="filter">✓ Verified Only</button></div>
