</section>

<section id="matches" class="view">
<div class="welcome"><div><h2>Your Matches</h2><p>Connections mutual and established.</p></div></div>
<div class="cards2">
  <div class="panel"><h3>Recent Matches</h3><div id="matchesList" class="matchList"></div></div>
  <div class="panel"><h3>Connection Tip</h3><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-muted)">Start with something personal: ask about their favourite layover destination, coffee spot, or roster memory rather than a generic opening line.</p></div>
</div>
